@startuml sequence-harvest-dry-run
!include elvira.iuml
' =============================================================================
' What: a librarian tests a source, dry-runs it, reads the ambiguous and unmatched records, and only then runs it;
'       the portal polls the job and refreshes the source's counters when it finishes.
' Kind: UML sequence diagram. Scope: the portal's source detail screen against the catalog API; the catalog's
'       Celery worker is shown as one participant.
' Source: EvilFlowersCatalog develop apps/harvest/views.py, apps/harvest/serializers.py (read 2026-11-16);
'         elvira-portal src/hooks/api/jobs/useJobs.ts (2026-11-16)
' =============================================================================

title Test, dry run, then run a harvest source (proposal, 2026-11-16)

actor Librarian as user
participant "Source detail\n(portal)" as ui <<proposed>> <<focus>>
participant "Catalog API\n/api/v1" as api
participant "Celery worker\nharvest.run" as worker

user -> ui : Test connection
ui -> api : POST harvest/sources/{id}/test
api --> ui : identify, formats, sets, sample, errors
ui --> user : identify card, sample book card

user -> ui : Dry run (primary action)
ui -[$accent_msg()]> api : <b>POST jobs {kind: harvest.run, subject_id, spec: {dry_run: true}}</b>
api ->> worker : queue run
loop every 8 s while queued or running
  ui -> api : GET jobs?kind=harvest.run&subject_id={id}
end
worker -->> api : records (dry_run=true), last_report
ui -> api : GET harvest/sources/{id}
api --> ui : dry_run_counts
ui -> api : GET …/records?dry_run=true&status=ambiguous
api --> ui : records
ui --> user : Ambiguous · Unmatched tabs first

user -> ui : Run (create mode: confirm first)
ui -> api : POST jobs {…, spec: {dry_run: false}}
note right of ui : Superusers only; catalog managers\nsee "runs follow the schedule".

$legend_live_proposed()

caption Dry run is the first and primary action; a real run into a catalog in create mode asks for confirmation, and progress comes from polling the jobs API.
footer ELVIRA · FIIT STU · elvira-portal · docs/diagrams/sequence-harvest-dry-run.puml
@enduml
